      "2. Confirm your optimisation event is the deepest one with sufficient volume. Shallow events buy cheap actions from people who never purchase.",
      "3. Upload and apply customer lists as exclusions on every prospecting campaign.",
      "4. Audit product feed titles and descriptions for specificity, treating them as ad copy rather than inventory data.",
      "5. Search your documentation and automation code for Advantage+ Shopping and legacy ASC or AAC API calls, and update against the v26 changelog.",
      "6. Test Threads as a placement while CPMs remain materially below Facebook Feed. Early placements rarely stay cheap.",
      "> The advertisers doing well under mandatory automation are not the ones who found a workaround. They are the ones who moved their effort to creative, offer and data, and stopped spending it on settings that no longer bind.",
