      "?? Does Meta still respect placement exclusions? | Partially. Meta may spend up to 5 percent on excluded placements unless you explicitly disable that flexibility at ad set level. If a placement is excluded for brand-safety reasons, disable the flexibility rather than assuming the exclusion is absolute.",
